# The Gobbiebag Part IX (jeuno 123) with its era module (quest rework B3b Jeuno, P4):
# modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/the_gobbiebag_part_1_to_10.lua, enabled by xi.pre(xi.expansion.SOA) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_SOA 0), raises the part's fame level to 8 (states 1 and 2's checks replaced) and adds state 3 (available, the
# start size, the previous part, fame below 8: 42 with the inventory + 1). The inventory at 70 (storage, after a first
# talk at 30: no state 3, 43 (81)), Parts I-VIII completed (the chain's earlier parts, by a GM). Fame level 7 (1099 / 2
# = 549): state 3's 42 (71); Part VIII set accepted (a GM): no section (43 (81)); completed again; fame level 8 (1100, a
# GM): 43 (71, 0, 1), begun; accepted at fame level 7: the module's state 2 check fails: no section, a trade: nothing;
# at 8: the four items: 73 (76), completed. A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it
# completed).
module modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/the_gobbiebag_part_1_to_10.lua
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
fame Sandoria 1099
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartV completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii completed
item OrichalcumIngot
item SquareOfPeisteLeather
item SquareOfOilSoakedCloth
item OxbloodOrb
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # available, fame below the era level, the inventory 30, not 70: no state 3; 43 (81)
finish
storage inventory 70                    # a GM: the part's start size
trigger Bluffnix                        # fame level 7, below the era level: state 3: 42 (71)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii accepted # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # state 3: the previous part not completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartViii completed # a GM
fame Sandoria 1100                      # a GM: fame level 8
trigger Bluffnix                        # the module's state 1 check: 43 (71, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
fame Sandoria 1099                      # a GM: fame level 7
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the module's state 2 check fails: no section; 43 (81)
finish
trade Bluffnix OrichalcumIngot x1 SquareOfPeisteLeather x1 SquareOfOilSoakedCloth x1 OxbloodOrb x1 # no section: nothing
fame Sandoria 1100                      # a GM
trade Bluffnix OrichalcumIngot x1 SquareOfPeisteLeather x1 SquareOfOilSoakedCloth x1 OxbloodOrb x1 # the module's state 2 check: 73 (76)
finish                                  # completed; inventory 75; INVENTORY_INCREASED
